{% if language == 'python' -%}
Claude formats each edited `.py` or `.pyi` file and runs `just lint` before
finishing a turn (see `.claude/settings.json`).
{%- elif language == 'rust' -%}
Claude formats each edited `.rs` file with rustfmt and runs `just lint` before
finishing a turn (see `.claude/settings.json`).
